{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13107030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13107030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1310703001:0":{"text":"ここも同じみたいですね……","source_cn":"咦，这里的祭典也没结束？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E64DD2DC49F84E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310703002:0":{"text":"でも、私たちの作った雪だるまが見当たらないわ。代わりに別の雪だるまが増えているような……？","source_cn":"但是雪人好像和昨天有点不一样。我们堆的雪人不见了，又似...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x880FE6DAD3562BB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310703003:1":{"text":"確かに！一緒に雪だるまを作った男の子はいないみたいだね。","source_cn":"对哦！不过那个和我们一起堆雪人的小孩子也不知道跑哪里去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC288428FE5893AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310703004:1":{"text":"マスター、もう一度雪だるまを作りますか？","source_cn":"主人，我们怎么办，还要再堆一次雪人吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7804A22FCAC801E7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、もう一度雪だるまを作りますか？","female":"マスター、もう一度雪だるまを作りますか？","variant_male_record_index":"144604","variant_female_record_index":"144605","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1310703004":{"text":"マスター、もう一度雪だるまを作りますか？","source_cn":"主人，我们怎么办，还要再堆一次雪人吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7804A22FCAC801E7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、もう一度雪だるまを作りますか？","fem